,"pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"衆議院議員 自由民主党奈良県第2選挙区支部長\n※総理在任中の投稿は、一部広報スタッフによるものを含みます。","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"sanae.gr.jp","expanded_url":"https://www.sanae.gr.jp/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/VNedKNdzy0"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":3030174,"following":0},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"rest_id":"218434058","super_follow_eligible":false,"super_followed_by":false,"super_following":false,"tweet_counts":{"media_tweets":591,"tweets":1889},"verification":{"verified":false,"verified_type":"Government"},"website":{"url":"https://t.co/VNedKNdzy0"}}}},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2112837922479325613"],"editable_until_msecs":"1792578390000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":true},"grok_analysis_button":true,"grok_annotations":{"is_image_editable_by_grok":true},"grok_translated_post_with_availability":{"is_available":false},"is_translatable":false,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":125,"bookmarked":false,"conversation_id_str":"2112837922479325613","created_at":"Wed Oct 21 09:26:30 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,77],"entities":{},"favorite_count":8617,"favorited":false,"full_text":"【高市内閣発足1周年に当たり⑦】\n\n今日から、高市内閣2年目の「挑戦」が始まります。\n\n目下の重要政策は、「世界的な物価高」を受けての更なる対策強化です。","id_str":"2112837922479325613","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":332,"reply_count":1660,"retweet_count":1031,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"218434058"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"kantei.go.jp/jp/105/stateme…","expanded_url":"https://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/105/statement/2026/1021kaiken.html","indices":[222,245],"url":"https://t.co/gZivRB3Y5P"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMTI4Mzc5MjI0MDgwMDk3Mjg=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"【高市内閣発足1周年に当たり⑦】\n\n今日から、高市内閣2年目の「挑戦」が始まります。\n\n目下の重要政策は、「世界的な物価高」を受けての更なる対策強化です。\n\n「決断と挑戦、そして実行の内閣」として、「重要な政策転換」を「実行」に移し､その「成果」を､日本列島の隅々までお届けしてまいります。\n\n「日本列島を、強く豊かに。」\n\n高市内閣の更なる歩みに、国民の皆様のご理解とご協力をお願い申し上げます。\n\n（参考）令和8年10月21日の会見の動画\nhttps://t.co/gZivRB3Y5P"}}},"rest_id":"2112837922479325613","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"695983","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2112837922479325613","sortIndex":"2112987302270599147"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"photo_image_full_size_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2112831853283667968/_Hv1vZpi?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2112831853283667968/_Hv1vZpi?format=jpg&name=280x150","width":200},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"総理の演説や記者会見などを、ノーカットの動画やテキストでご覧になれます。","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.kantei.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":300,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2112831853283667968/_Hv1vZpi?format=jpg&name=400x400","width":400},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"summary_photo_image_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":202,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2112831853283667968/_Hv1vZpi?format=jpg&name=386x202","width":386},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_